#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:17
msgid ""
"Bit CRM keeps the people and businesses you work with in your own WordPress "
"database. The text below is a starting point. Change it so it describes "
"what you really collect, why you are allowed to, and how long you keep it."
msgstr ""
"Bit CRM 將您合作的人員和企業保存在您自己的 WordPress "
"資料庫中。以下文字是一個起點。請更改它以描述您實際收集的內容、您被允許收集的原因，以及您保存資料的時間長度。"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:19
msgid "What we keep about you and why"
msgstr "我們保留關於您的資訊及原因"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:20
msgid ""
"When you get in touch with us, become a customer, or are introduced to us, "
"we create a record for you in our customer database. It holds your name, "
"email address, phone number, postal address and your role at your company, "
"along with the notes, tasks, calls, meetings, files and links our team "
"saves while working with you. We use this to keep track of our "
"conversations, to follow up on sales, to send you invoices and to stay in "
"contact."
msgstr ""
"當您與我們聯絡、成為客戶或被介紹給我們時，我們會在客戶資料庫中為您建立紀錄。該紀錄包含您的姓名、電子郵件地址、電話號碼、郵寄地址以及您在公司的職務，還有"
"我們團隊在與您合作時保存的筆記、任務、通話、會議、檔案和連結。我們用這些來追蹤對話、跟進銷售、寄送發票，以及保持聯絡。"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:21
msgid ""
"If our team connects a mailbox to the database, the emails sent between "
"that mailbox and your address are copied in as well, so your conversation "
"history sits next to your record. This includes the subject, the message "
"text, the sender and recipient details and the names of any attachments."
msgstr ""
"如果我們的團隊將郵箱連接到資料庫，該郵箱與您的地址之間發送的電子郵件也會被複製進來，讓您的對話歷史與您的紀錄並列。這包括主旨、郵件文字、寄件人與收件人詳"
"細資料以及任何附件的名稱。"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:23
msgid "Who can see it"
msgstr "誰可以看到"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:24
msgid ""
"Only the members of our team who have been given access to the customer "
"database can see your record. If we send you a link to an invoice, anyone "
"who has that link can open the invoice."
msgstr "只有被授權存取客戶資料庫的團隊成員可以看到您的紀錄。如果我們寄給您發票連結，任何擁有該連結的人都可以開啟該發票。"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:26
msgid "Where your information goes"
msgstr "您的資訊流向"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:27
msgid ""
"Emails and invoices we send you travel through our email provider. Emails "
"we sync from a connected mailbox are fetched from that mail provider, for "
"example Gmail or Zoho. If you pay an invoice online, the payment is handled "
"by the payment provider shown on the invoice, and that provider receives "
"your name, billing details and the amount. The pages we show you, such as a "
"shared invoice, load their fonts from Google Fonts, which receives your IP "
"address when the page loads."
msgstr ""
"我們寄給您的電子郵件和發票會經過我們的電子郵件服務提供者。從連接的郵箱同步的電子郵件則從該郵件提供者（例如 Gmail 或 "
"Zoho）擷取。如果您在線上支付發票，付款由發票上顯示的付款提供者處理，該提供者會收到您的姓名、帳單資料和金額。我們展示給您的頁面，例如共享發票，會從 "
"Google Fonts 載入字體，當頁面載入時，Google Fonts 會收到您的 IP 位址。"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:29
msgid "How long we keep it"
msgstr "我們保存的時間"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:30
msgid ""
"We keep your record for as long as we are working together and for as long "
"as the law requires afterwards. Invoices, and the records they rely on, are "
"kept for the period that accounting and tax rules demand."
msgstr "我們會在合作期間及法律要求的期限內保存您的紀錄。發票及其依據的紀錄會依會計和稅務規定保存相應期間。"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:32
msgid "Your choices"
msgstr "您的選擇"

#: backend/app/Services/Privacy/PrivacyPolicyContent.php:33
msgid ""
"You can ask us for a copy of everything we hold about you, and you can ask "
"us to delete it. When you ask us to delete, we remove your lead and contact "
"records, everything saved on them, and the emails we stored from our "
"conversations. If your record is tied to deals or invoices that we are "
"required to keep, we strip your personal details from those records and "
"keep only the anonymized business information."
msgstr ""
"您可以向我們索取我們持有的所有關於您的資料副本，也可以要求我們刪除。當您要求刪除時，我們會移除您的潛在客戶及聯絡人紀錄、所有儲存在其上的資料，以及我們從"
"對話中儲存的電子郵件。如果您的紀錄與我們必須保留的交易或發票相關聯，我們會從這些紀錄中刪除您的個人資料，只保留匿名的業務資訊。"

